  "title": "Bill Gates",
  "summary": "Born in Seattle on 28 October 1955, Gates developed a version of BASIC for the Altair 8800 while a Harvard student, and in 1975 he and Paul Allen founded Microsoft in Albuquerque, New Mexico, where the Altair's maker was based. Microsoft moved to Washington State in 1979. Since 2008 Gates has devoted his energies to the Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation.",
